{"path":"docs/agents/domain.md","ref":"2c167c094b21500cfcbf4733064d83f6a69dc4f7","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":1,"text":"# Domain Docs"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":3,"text":"How the engineering skills should consume this repo's domain documentation when exploring the codebase."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":5,"text":"## Before exploring, read these"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":7,"text":"- **`CONTEXT.md`** at the repo root, or"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":8,"text":"- **`CONTEXT-MAP.md`** at the repo root if it exists; it points at one `CONTEXT.md` per context. Read each one relevant to the topic."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":9,"text":"- **`docs/adr/`**; read ADRs that touch the area you're about to work in. In multi-context repos, also check `src/<context>/docs/adr/` for context-scoped decisions."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":10,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":11,"text":"If any of these files do not exist, **proceed silently**. Do not flag their absence; do not suggest creating them upfront. The `/domain-modeling` skill, reached via `/grill-with-docs` and `/improve-codebase-architecture`, creates them lazily when terms or decisions actually get resolved."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":13,"text":"## File structure"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":14,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":15,"text":"Single-context repo, used by this repo:"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":16,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":17,"text":"```text"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":18,"text":"/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":19,"text":"|-- CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":20,"text":"|-- docs/adr/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":21,"text":"|   |-- 0001-event-sourced-orders.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":22,"text":"|   `-- 0002-postgres-for-write-model.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":23,"text":"`-- src/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":24,"text":"```"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":26,"text":"Multi-context repo, indicated by `CONTEXT-MAP.md` at the root:"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":27,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":28,"text":"```text"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":29,"text":"/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":30,"text":"|-- CONTEXT-MAP.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":31,"text":"|-- docs/adr/                          <- system-wide decisions"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":32,"text":"`-- src/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":33,"text":"    |-- ordering/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":34,"text":"    |   |-- CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":35,"text":"    |   `-- docs/adr/                  <- context-specific decisions"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":36,"text":"    `-- billing/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":37,"text":"        |-- CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":38,"text":"        `-- docs/adr/"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":39,"text":"```"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":41,"text":"## Use the glossary's vocabulary"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":43,"text":"When your output names a domain concept, such as in an issue title, refactor proposal, hypothesis, or test name, use the term as defined in `CONTEXT.md`. Do not drift to synonyms the glossary explicitly avoids."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":44,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":45,"text":"If the concept you need is not in the glossary yet, that is a signal: either you are inventing language the project does not use, or there is a real gap to note for `/domain-modeling`."},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":46,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":47,"text":"## Flag ADR conflicts"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":48,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":49,"text":"If your output contradicts an existing ADR, surface it explicitly rather than silently overriding:"},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":50,"text":""},{"sha":"2a2d7910207a4ef9a7d29c77f8ba2e904a638be0","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783544569,"line":51,"text":"> Contradicts ADR-0007 (event-sourced orders), but worth reopening because..."}]}
